  "brain_first": "“先看题目要找哪一栏；不要从左上角开始逐字读。”",
  "sort_order": 1032,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "RECOGNISE - How it usually looks",
      "sourcePage": 51,
      "sourceIndex": 1418
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "材料不是长文章，而是 timetable, chart, notice,",
      "sourcePage": 51,
      "sourceIndex": 1419
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "map, menu, rules, webpage cards 等；问题多问",
      "sourcePage": 51,
      "sourceIndex": 1420
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "时间、价格、资格、路线、限制和匹配。",
      "sourcePage": 51,
      "sourceIndex": 1421
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "TERM - What the term really means",
      "sourcePage": 51,
      "sourceIndex": 1422
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Non-continuous / practical text：信息分散在栏",
      "sourcePage": 51,
      "sourceIndex": 1423
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "目、表格、标签和图示中，不需要按文章顺序阅",
      "sourcePage": 51,
      "sourceIndex": 1424
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "读。",
      "sourcePage": 51,
      "sourceIndex": 1425
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "THINK - First sentence in your head: “先看题目要找哪一栏；不要从左上角开始逐字读。”",
      "sourcePage": 51,
      "sourceIndex": 1426
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "WHY - Why this works: 这类题主要考“精准筛选条件”。基础学生如果先圈条件，再交叉核对，通常比读长",
      "sourcePage": 51,
      "sourceIndex": 1427
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "文章更容易稳定拿分。",
      "sourcePage": 51,
      "sourceIndex": 1428
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "STEPS - Follow this route",
      "sourcePage": 51,
      "sourceIndex": 1429
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "11. 1 先圈题干中的对象 + 条件：谁、哪天、几点、多少钱、能不能、从哪里到哪里。",
      "sourcePage": 51,
      "sourceIndex": 1430
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "12. 2 直接跳到对应栏：日期题看 Date/Time；费用题看 Price/Fee；资格题看 Age/For/Requirements；路线题",
      "sourcePage": 51,
      "sourceIndex": 1431
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "看起点、终点、方向。",
      "sourcePage": 51,
      "sourceIndex": 1432
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "13. 3 如果答案要同时满足两个以上条件，在草稿上写成“条件A ✓ / 条件B ✓ / 条件C ✓”。",
      "sourcePage": 51,
      "sourceIndex": 1433
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "14. 4 规则类特别圈 must, may, can, cannot, only, except, before, after。",
      "sourcePage": 51,
      "sourceIndex": 1434
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "15. 5 最终选项逐项核对，任何一个条件不满足就删。",
      "sourcePage": 51,
      "sourceIndex": 1435
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "✏ 草稿纸上具体写什么： 圈题干人物/时间/地点/段落/核心名词/NOT；定位后在段边写题号；必要时写",
      "sourcePage": 51,
      "sourceIndex": 1436
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "“证据→选项”。",
      "sourcePage": 51,
      "sourceIndex": 1437
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "IF/THEN - If... then...",
      "sourcePage": 51,
      "sourceIndex": 1438
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· If 题目问“最早/最便宜/最适合” → 先筛掉不符合硬条件的，再比较。",
      "sourcePage": 51,
      "sourceIndex": 1439
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· If 是地图/路线 → 先固定起点和终点，再看方向/换乘，不要被附近地名吸走。",
      "sourcePage": 51,
      "sourceIndex": 1440
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· If 是网页卡片 → 标题、日期、按钮、脚注、备注都可能是证据。",
      "sourcePage": 51,
      "sourceIndex": 1441
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "STOP - Stop when: 唯一一个选项满足题干全部条件。",
      "sourcePage": 51,
      "sourceIndex": 1442
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "STUCK - If you are stuck: 把题干条件拆成小勾选框；不要一次在脑中同时记四五个限制。",
      "sourcePage": 52,
      "sourceIndex": 1443
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "EXAMPLE - Worked example",
      "sourcePage": 52,
      "sourceIndex": 1444
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "活动表：A活动 15:00、免费、14岁以上；B活动 14:30、$5、全年龄。题目问“13岁学生下午3点后能参加",
      "sourcePage": 52,
      "sourceIndex": 1445
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "的免费活动”，A因年龄不符，B因收费不符，所以二者都不能选。关键不是“看见3点”，而是全部条件",
      "sourcePage": 52,
      "sourceIndex": 1446
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "同时成立。",
      "sourcePage": 52,
      "sourceIndex": 1447
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "TRAPS - Common traps",
      "sourcePage": 52,
      "sourceIndex": 1448
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "只看一个数字就选；忽略脚注/年龄限制；地图题把“经过某地”当成“终点”；看到原词就忽略其他条件。",
      "sourcePage": 52,
      "sourceIndex": 1449
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "CHECK - Final check",
      "sourcePage": 52,
      "sourceIndex": 1450
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "对象对吗？时间对吗？费用/年龄/资格对吗？有没有 only / except / before 等限制？",
      "sourcePage": 52,
      "sourceIndex": 1451
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "🔧 纠错动作： 做完不要只对答案，先给错误归类。错误代码： R-L 定位错｜R-P 同义替换错｜R-I 过度推",
      "sourcePage": 52,
      "sourceIndex": 1452
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "断｜R-S 范围/程度偷换｜R-N NOT/EXCEPT漏看｜R-M 主旨范围错。",
      "sourcePage": 52,
      "sourceIndex": 1453
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "同一种错误连续出现2次 → 在对应代码旁画★，下次做题先检查这一项。",
      "sourcePage": 52,
      "sourceIndex": 1454
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "MEMORY - 30-second memory: 先找对应栏，再做条件交集；所有条件都打勾才选。",
      "sourcePage": 52,
      "sourceIndex": 1455
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "可选巩固｜5题（查完SOP后再做）",
      "sourcePage": 52,
      "sourceIndex": 1457
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "1. 日程题问“周日15:00后免费”，第一步？",
      "sourcePage": 52,
      "sourceIndex": 1458
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "2. 地图题先固定哪两个点？",
      "sourcePage": 52,
      "sourceIndex": 1459
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "3. 规则“only members under 18”，19岁会员可以吗？",
      "sourcePage": 52,
      "sourceIndex": 1460
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "4. 表格题一个选项时间对但年龄不符，能选吗？",
      "sourcePage": 52,
      "sourceIndex": 1461
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "5. 网页脚注信息会不会成为证据？",
      "sourcePage": 52,
      "sourceIndex": 1462
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "答案速查：1. 圈日期+时间+费用三个条件。；2. 起点和终点。；3. 不可以。；4. 不能。；5. 会。",
      "sourcePage": 52,
      "sourceIndex": 1463
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "— R18 本题型到这里。下次卡住直接 Ctrl+F 搜“R18”或题型关键词。—",
      "sourcePage": 52,
      "sourceIndex": 1464
    }
  ],
